   7:src/util/luapattern.c **** // Depth accounting is centralized in do_match(); all other helpers assume
   8:src/util/luapattern.c **** // they run inside its bracket. Subjects and patterns carry explicit lengths
   9:src/util/luapattern.c **** // (NUL-safe). Malformed patterns set ms->err instead of raising.
